context"},{"id":"src_x_parker_afpac_x","label":"Cross-case ref src_x_parker_afpac_x","kind":"sibling case","retrievedAt":"2026-08-26T19:50:00Z","reliability":"medium","sourceRole":"context"},{"id":"src_jta_gage_exit_x","label":"Cross-case ref src_jta_gage_exit_x","kind":"sibling case","retrievedAt":"2026-08-26T19:50:00Z","reliability":"medium","sourceRole":"context"},{"id":"src_jpost_detroit_x","label":"Cross-case ref src_jpost_detroit_x","kind":"sibling case","retrievedAt":"2026-08-26T19:50:00Z","reliability":"medium","sourceRole":"context"},{"id":"src_mirror_platforms_case06","label":"Cross-case ref src_mirror_platforms_case06","kind":"sibling case","retrievedAt":"2026-08-26T19:50:00Z","reliability":"medium","sourceRole":"context"},{"id":"src_archive_sources_case04","label":"Cross-case ref src_archive_sources_case04","kind":"sibling case","retrievedAt":"2026-08-26T19:50:00Z","reliability":"medium","sourceRole":"context"},{"id":"src_intersection","label":"Cross-case ref","retrievedAt":"2026-08-26T19:50:00Z","reliability":"medium","sourceRole":"context"},{"id":"src_supply_chain","label":"Cross-case ref","retrievedAt":"2026-08-26T19:50:00Z","reliability":"medium","sourceRole":"context"},{"id":"src_t2_nawfal","label":"Cross-case ref","retrievedAt":"2026-08-26T19:50:00Z","reliability":"medium","sourceRole":"context"},{"id":"src_mirror_t0","label":"Cross-case ref","retrievedAt":"2026-08-26T19:50:00Z","reliability":"medium","sourceRole":"context"},{"id":"src_gbc_feed_case07","label":"Cross-case ref","retrievedAt":"2026-08-26T19:50:00Z","reliability":"medium","sourceRole":"context"}],"findings":["**Two pipelines, not one.** Palestinian aggregators document Gaza; Iran-war wires feed influencers. The two almost never cross.","**The only confirmed production cell is Hinkle–Gulag–ACP**, and it's self-declared in his bio — not covert coordination.","**The Kirk assassination is the ecosystem's fracture line**: it split Gage from Shields/Peters, drives Candace's investigation economy, fuels Parker's \"dual operation\" frame, and is uniformly rejected by court evidence.","**Monetization shapes content more than ideology does**: Rainbet (gambling) sponsors both Jvnior and Sneako; Truthteller charges $1000 to unblock; Wallace/Lucre run pure engagement bait with zero conflict content.","**Bot amplification is documented historically** (Cyabra 40% fake followers for Hinkle; NCRI false-flag pipeline) but was NOT independently re-verified in this program's T0 windows.","**No evidence of a single command structure** across any two groups. Every proposed inter-group edge is either audience spillover, shared upstream wire, or individual personality choice.","**Category discipline matters**: Gaza journalists ≠ anonymous archives ≠ Western outlets ≠ named professors ≠ parody accounts. The dataset preserves these distinctions."],"executiveSummary":["Eight case packets covering ~200 accounts, ~400 harvested posts, and ~50 documented edges reveal a **fragmented information ecosystem, not a single coordinated operation**. The Hinkle/Gulag production cell is the only proven integrated unit (70% same-hour amplification, bio-declared). The far-right cluster is fracturing post-Kirk. The Muslim-personality lane monetizes through gambling while fighting Israel advocates. The aggregators supply a *different* pipeline than the one influencers actually drink from. The anti-empire corridor maintains editorial standards distinct from influencer clipping but is parasitized as a clip source. The mega-amplifiers ignore seed content entirely. The state/covert press layer operates at industrial cadence but has no proven pipe into seeds."],"wouldChange":["Discovery that Gulag is an independent fan account would downgrade case-01 rel_05 to mutualism","A single documented GBC/IRGC-persona caption appearing verbatim in Hinkle or Sulaiman feeds would establish the missing state-to-influencer pipe","Evidence of shared staff/funding between any two group leaders would collapse the seven-community model into fewer clusters","Proof that Wallace/Lucre DO relay seed clips outside sampled windows would restore the amplifier model"],"limitations":["All cases used convenience samples (mirror layers + API precision slices); relative timestamps on mirror layer; no video playback (caption-vs-footage fidelity untested); engagement figures decay; no follow-graph pulled per operator decision; T1/T2 historical windows under-sampled relative to T0; Arabic/Hebrew/Farsi reply mining shallow."],"unknowns":[]}